WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.019
Welcome to AroNexa for labs. Here's a quick look at the lab and the pathologist's side.

00:06.019 --> 00:13.403
Today shows new requests, samples to collect and reports in progress. Assign a collector for home visits.

00:13.403 --> 00:19.229
Requests come from doctors and patients. Send a quote, or reject one with a reason.

00:19.229 --> 00:23.072
Samples follows each one from collection to processing.

00:23.072 --> 00:27.341
Schedule plans home collections and lab visits through the day.

00:27.341 --> 00:32.741
When results are ready, upload the report files and send them to the pathologist.

00:32.741 --> 00:36.499
The pathologist sees every report waiting for review.

00:36.499 --> 00:44.011
Check the values, add a reading, and publish. The doctor and patient are told straight away. Now, start exploring.
